  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Welcome to Clipgolf affiliates. Our goals in the golf industry are to help people improve their swings and lower their scores. We believe that the best way to become a more consistent golfer is to establish an effective technique in practice that you are confident taking out onto the course. Using Clipgolf customers will be able to get an honest reflection of their own swing both on and off the course and by analysing their own swing and comparing it to proffesionals, they can identify parts of their swing that may need changing or requires some work. Clipgolf is designed to be attatched directly to golf bags, trolleys or surfaces at the range which enables golfers to keep up with pace of play on the course, only having to set their trolley or bag down behind their shot before so they can clip their swing.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our target audience are young male golfers, between the ages of 18-35 who play golf to improve and strive to reach a good level of golf and who are keen to work on their swing.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">All affiliates will be paid a commision of 15% of every sale that they make, paid by bank transfer with the option for their commision to increase over time as they show that they are am integral part of this business.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We are really looking forward to working alongside you and we wish you the very best of luck!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;-Team Clipgolf</p>",
